lens_profiles.invalid = Tlhopha polokelo ya Lensfun v1/v2 XML e e siameng (go fitlha 8 MiB) e e nang le tshedimosetso ya khamera kgotsa lens e e tshegediwang.
lens_profiles.calibration = Tekanyetso ya lens
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Ga go na tekanyetso e e tsamaisanang le dithulaganyo tseno. Tlhola boleele jwa tsepamiso le ntlha ya go sega ya khamera; paakanyo ya diatla e sa ntse e le teng.
lens_profiles.import = Tsenya Lensfun XML…
lens_profiles.imported = Polokelo ya Lensfun e tsentswe mo tirisong eno. Tlhopha profaele kgotsa o e bapise le metadata ya setshwantsho.
lens_profiles.manual = Paakanyo ya diatla fela
lens_profiles.saved = Tekanyetso e e bolokilweng (polokelo ga e teng)
lens_profiles.profile = Profaele ya lens
lens_profiles.aperture = Phatlha ya lens (0 = ga e itsiwe)
lens_profiles.distance = Sekgala sa tsepamiso (0 = ga se itsiwe)
lens_profiles.vignette = Go fifala ga mathoko go go lekanyeditsweng
lens_profiles.color_context = Go fifala ga mathoko go go lekanyeditsweng go tlhoka profaele ya sRGB e e agilweng mo teng. Fetolela go sRGB go boloka tebego, mme o bule Paakanyo ya Lens gape. Mo dipikiseleng tse di setseng di le sRGB mme di sena letshwao, go di abela profaele ya sRGB go lekane. Paakanyo ya sebopego le ya mathoko a mebala e sa ntse e le teng.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Ga go na tekanyetso ya go fifala ga mathoko e e tsamaelanang le phatlha ya lens le sekgala sa tsepamiso. Tsenya dilekanyo tse di lekantsweng go e dirisa; 1000 m e kaya tsepamiso ya kgakala mo diprofaeleng tse dintsi tsa Lensfun.
lens_profiles.note = Paakanyo e e lekanyeditsweng e dira pele ga ditaolo tsa diatla. Dirisa foreimi yotlhe ya setshwantsho sa ntlha; se sege morago. Boloka mokgobo wa difiltara mo PSD/PSB gore tekanyetso e nne e ka baakanngwa.
lens_profiles.automatic = Bapisa metadata ya setshwantsho
lens_profiles.components = Kgato ya profaele: go sologa {distortion}; mathoko a mebala {tca}; go fifala ga mathoko {vignette}.
